WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.480
Speaker 1: Well, truth social is very rapidly&nbsp;
heading towards bankruptcy. And I actually do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:13.680
like this, but not because I necessarily want&nbsp;
to see it fail, but because it does confirm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:21.480
that the demand that the right claims is there for&nbsp;
some completely unfettered free speech platform,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:27.480
for the right to be allowed to say what they want&nbsp;
really isn't there. There really isn't the demand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:32.400
for it. So let's back up a little bit. Truth&nbsp;
social is this right wing social media platform.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:37.740
It's Donald Trump's social media platform to&nbsp;
some degree. And the idea of truth social was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:42.180
all of the conservative voices being censored on&nbsp;
Twitter and elsewhere. You're going to be able&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:46.440
to go to truth social and you will be free to say&nbsp;
whatever you want. Everyone can say whatever they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:52.680
want on truth social. Turns out number one wasn't&nbsp;
actually the case. Lots of people getting banned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:57.000
on truth social for talking about the January six&nbsp;
committee hearings or for all bunch of different&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.200
things. So it turns out it wasn't really this free&nbsp;
speech platform they claim it would be. Secondly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.180
turns out it wasn't really a platform too many&nbsp;
people were interested in. And the latest sort&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:12.900
of nail in the coffin is that investors are&nbsp;
pulling almost $140 million from the company that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:19.860
is planning to merge with Trump's truth social.&nbsp;
The Businessinsider article writes The deadline&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:26.880
for Digital World to acquire Trump's Truth Social&nbsp;
Past on September 20th, investors are walking away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:34.920
from planned commitments of $140 million. Reuters&nbsp;
reports that savvy management investors bowed out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:45.480
taking away $100 million. This is going to likely&nbsp;
be the demise of truth, social and of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:50.760
as far as these investors go, the fact that they&nbsp;
were going to invest in the first place shows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:56.460
that they're not necessarily the most brilliant&nbsp;
investors. Many of the businesses that Trump is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.460 --> 00:02:03.720
a part of end up going under and investors lose&nbsp;
money. Trump tries to run away with the cash, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:10.080
it's a complete and total disaster. But I think&nbsp;
the most important, the reason I love this is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:16.680
that they love to say the entire right. And, you&nbsp;
know, they sometimes they'll claim the right is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:23.820
225 million people. Trump recently said 75 million&nbsp;
people voted for him and that there's probably&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:28.860
another 150 million Trumpists as well. The numbers&nbsp;
don't even make sense. Absurd numbers if you look&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:35.100
at how many adults there are in the US makes no&nbsp;
sense whatsoever. But their story is there's tens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:42.360
of millions or hundreds of millions of us. We are&nbsp;
being silenced on Twitter and everywhere else, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:47.460
we really want a platform where we can say what&nbsp;
we want and say what we believe. And it's going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:51.720
to be great and it's going to be profitable and&nbsp;
it's going to explode. They create truth, social,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.380 --> 00:03:00.300
and it just kind of goes nowhere. And what I love&nbsp;
is that truth social is failing in the marketplace&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:07.680
of ideas. Nobody's censoring truth social.&nbsp;
Nobody's shutting it down. But slowly but surely,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:14.880
people don't care. They don't really have users.&nbsp;
And it just declines and declines and declines.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:20.640
And it looks like ultimately it's going to end&nbsp;
up going under completely. It will, of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:27.960
be blamed on radical leftists, globalists,&nbsp;
whatever. But the reason it's failing is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:33.540
because it's terrible and it's even sort of like&nbsp;
