a Twitter clone. And so if your belief is Twitter&nbsp;
on a technical level is fine, but it needs to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:50.760
free from censorship of conservatives, then by&nbsp;
definition, truth social should be doing really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:55.860
well. It's not it's not doing well and it's&nbsp;
going to go under. And I absolutely love it.

